{"title": "Thermodynamo", "pageid": 28069, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Thermodynamo", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Thermodynamo</b> is a passive feature that grants Heat when you deal damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Whenever you deal damage with this weapon, you gain 2 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Heat\"> Condition: Heat </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Engulfed by a vengeful fire. Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage each turn, but can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence\" title=\"Heat Convergence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Convergence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence\" title=\"Heat Convergence\">Heat Convergence</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Heat Convergence</b> consumes all remaining turns of <b>Heat</b> to deal extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage on their next fire spell or attack.</li>\n<li><b>Heat</b> has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 7 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Greataxe\" title=\"Hellfire Greataxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Greataxe\" title=\"Hellfire Greataxe\">Hellfire Greataxe</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thermodynamo_Axe\" title=\"Thermodynamo Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Thermodynamo_Axe\" title=\"Thermodynamo Axe\">Thermodynamo Axe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>It is not listed in-game, but Thermodynamo can only activate once per attack, even when hitting multiple targets with <a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a> or similar abilities.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202452\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1953/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22759/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4540/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory 